    {
      "id": "UgzXngmJqiRJQIMDeh94AaABAg",
      "author": "@ElbertJacob-z1m",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kFKyUfpTt-g7ZZ-6LZ1sANP6791YgWTIsbAPxggknb2p4vMYee8SivclGdDEQnvFVPyg=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Watching from the Philippines. My entire family of 5 plus my daughter-in-law was there in Spring of 2023 as I treated them to a 10-country, 35-day tour of Europe after my early retirement in end-2022 but it’s only after watching this video that I realized this particular amazing triumph of man over the ocean which no doubt makes Netherlands a prized jewel of Europe and a beautiful country like the Philippines. Wow, what a sight to behold those long fields littered with tulips in bloom, the age-old windmills and canals among many others. Blessed indeed to have been to Holland and won’t have second thoughts going back given the chance.  Thanks to Mading Cheryl, Rose et. al for keeping us company in those precious moments.  Godspeed and regards ❤",
