      "text": "WATCHING FROM SPAIN, BUT I HOPE THE PHILIPPINES WILL HAVE THIS DEFENCE AND WALL PROTECTION, MY COUNTRY THE PHILIPPINES  , SUFFER A LOT, WHEN RAINNY SEASON COME, HOPE OUR GOVT  WILL  WATCH THIS VIDEO,",
